   "en": "As Japan, conquer Mexico then Europe before 1945."
  },
  {
   "k": "197w24g",
   "en": "The achievement ⟦0⟧ requires ⟦1⟧ to annex ⟦2⟧ before taking European land, then conquer a coastal state in Europe. This must all be done before 1945. The name of the achievement alludes to the Sunset Invasion achievement which references the Sunset Invasion DLC from Crusader Kings II.",
